/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-d30776e150c88bc5END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-4733f3590101d709END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_LOW_LetterFromDockerCrew</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_LOW_LetterFromDockerCrew\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_LOW_LetterFromDockerCrew\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">7ee0d81b-79f5-420c-9d7d-6551897675b0</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7ee0d81b-79f5-420c-9d7d-6551897675b0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7ee0d81b-79f5-420c-9d7d-6551897675b0\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Bruc_and_Pishe%27s_Emporium\" title=\"Bruc and Pishe's Emporium\">Bruc and Pishe's Emporium</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-2335&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1066</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A letter from the chairwoman of the Docker's Guild.]\n</p><p><br>\nNine-Fingers,\n</p><p>From my esteemed organisation to yours - the Fist and their Steel Watch still insist on searching every shipment that comes in. Trading vessels are trying their luck further up the coast, which means less work for my membership. If there aren't any shipments for your people to protect, then there aren't any protection fees for my people to pay. That would be a sad day for commerce, don't you agree?\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715050142\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1359/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25217/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6750/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931116/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.236      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   42.236      1 -total\n 45.93%   19.400      6 Template:Icon_text\n 40.55%   17.128     15 Template:Trim\n 21.86%    9.233      2 Template:Uid\n 20.17%    8.519      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.85%    5.429      2 Template:Template_style\n  9.90%    4.183      1 Template:Notes\n  9.67%    4.086      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.57%    4.042      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35175-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715050142 and revision id 238111. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}